      "id": 1,
      "text": "John Wever and his wife Mercy founded Wevertown in the late 1700s, operating a sawmill that sparked the hamlet's early growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
